{
  "statement_html": "<p>\\(A B C D\\) est un parallélogramme tel que \\(A B = 2\\) cm, \\(A C = 6\\) cm et \\(B D = 5\\) cm. \tCalculer la valeur exacte de \\(B C\\).</p>\t<p>\\(B C =\\) <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"4\"></span> cm.</p>\t<div class=\"wims_instruction\">Pour \\(\\sqrt{...}\\), écrire : sqrt(...)</div>",
  "answers": [
